DESCRIPTION:How many comedians can tell one joke each\, in an hour? We're g
 oing to find out. One Joke is a one-of-a-kind experience as each comedian t
 ells just one single perfect joke before leaving the stage. All in the name
  of charity. It's a rapid fire\, rip-roaring\, completely contextless joke 
 factory with the best and biggest line-up on the Fringe. Join us for an hou
 r of jokes\, jokes\, jokes and jokes. Hosted by Jonathan Oldfield (BBC New 
 Comedy Awards) and headlined by Lorna Rose Treen (SNL writer) with the joke
  that 'killed comedy' (Sun).\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atl
 as/event/one-joke/
